s/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7c3a3a07e0fd4c89END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-17d3b2e7ca4ccdacEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GEN_History_FFElturelTranscript</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_History_FFElturelTranscript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_History_FFElturelTranscript\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">79ecffbe-ee7f-44bb-9131-393e4ec8fade</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:79ecffbe-ee7f-44bb-9131-393e4ec8fade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:79ecffbe-ee7f-44bb-9131-393e4ec8fade\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</a>, in the burning room with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Benryn\" title=\"Benryn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/25px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/38px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/50px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Benryn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/25px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Benryn\" title=\"Benryn\">Benryn</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-80&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;619</span></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>In <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash's</a> office mezzanine on a bookshelf</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;59&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-60</span></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/The_Wyrmway\" title=\"The Wyrmway\">The Wyrmway</a>, on a bookshelf in the Chamber of Insight at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-943&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-982</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Though an official document, this appears to be one of many hastily-produced copies documenting the night of Elturel's Descent Into Avernus.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: I am acting Gauntlet Emyr of the Flaming Fist. Repeat what you told my people for the room to hear.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shepherd: You should be helping - aren't you supposed to help?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: First, I need to know what happened.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shepherd: It's gone. The city. The light. The Companion. I was born in its glow... never seen real darkness before.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: Get a grip on yourself, man.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shepherd: There was no sound to begin with. The sky flickered, dark and then light again. Then the Companion changed... from gold to black. My farm's almost a half-day's ride from the city, but I could hear the screams. Thousands of people, plunged into darkness while the world went mad.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: And then?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shepherd: More lights - but dark lights. It makes no sense, I know. They came from the Companion, wicked streaks stabbing into the city and tearing it apart. Then the sky, the ground, the buildings, they all... folded in on themselves. Like an invisible hand were crushing them.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: And the city?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shepherd: There is no city! Elturel is gone!\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: When did this happen?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shepherd: Yesterday. I fled through the darkness, until I found you. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: Lock him up. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shepherd: I've done nothing wrong! You've got to go and help them!\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Emyr: He's the eleventh we've picked up since morning. Make copies, deliver the transcript to every Flaming Fist post from here to the <a href=\"/wiki/Risen_Road\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Risen Road\">Risen Road</a> by hand. Until we know exactly what's happening out there, nobody from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elturgard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elturgard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elturgard\">Elturgard</a></span> goes west. And don't talk to anyone outside the Fist about this. Maintain control.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213008\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2581/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48564/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18941/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 5/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1043154/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.637      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   53.637      1 -total\n 52.75%   28.294     11 Template:Icon_text\n 45.2